  "id": 2831,
  "slug": "find-the-longest-equal-subarray",
  "title": "找出最长等值子数组",
  "status": "published",
  "qualityGate": "tested",
  "batch": "batch-047",
  "studyTags": [
    "数组",
    "哈希表",
    "滑动窗口"
  ],
  "summary": "最多删除 k 个元素后，求数组中可形成的最长连续等值子数组长度。",
  "insight": "对每个值只看其出现下标列表。保留从 positions[left] 到 positions[right] 的这些相同值时，需要删除的夹杂元素数为位置跨度减去保留元素间距；用滑动窗口维持该数不超过 k。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "答案是保留的相同元素数量",
    "删除只需发生在首末保留位置之间",
    "缺口数为 pos[right]-pos[left]-(right-left)",
    "不同值可独立处理"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "position-lists-sliding-window",
      "title": "出现位置列表滑动窗口",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "在同值下标序列中控制需要删除的缺口数量。",
      "steps": [
        "按 value 收集递增出现下标",
        "对每个 positions 列表 left=0",
        "右移 right",
        "当 positions[right]-positions[left]-(right-left)>k 时 left++",
        "用 right-left+1 更新答案"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(n)",
        "space": "O(n)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/position-lists-sliding-window/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/position-lists-sliding-window/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/position-lists-sliding-window/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
}
